WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:03.428
GRASS.

00:00:01.593 --> 00:00:05.364
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO IS PELOSI THE

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:07.466
SECRET GRAND WIZARD?

00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:07.733
WE'LL SEE IF SHE GETS DENOUNCED,

00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:10.168
TOO.

00:00:07.866 --> 00:00:12.671
CAN'T WAIT.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:15.207
READY TO GET A GUN CONTROL

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.574
LECTURE NEXT TIME YOU GO TO

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.309
DOCTOR.

00:00:15.707 --> 00:00:19.778
DOCTORS ARE BEING URGED TO

00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:21.413
CAMPAIGN FOR GUN CONTROL AND HOW

00:00:19.911 --> 00:00:24.649
UNSAFE IT IS TO OWN GUNS.

00:00:21.546 --> 00:00:26.151
THE EDITORIAL SAYS DON'T LET

00:00:24.783 --> 00:00:33.725
YOUR CONCERNS FOR PERCEIVED

00:00:26.284 --> 00:00:35.127
POLITICAL VIEWS.

00:00:33.859 --> 00:00:39.164
DOCTOR, THANKS FOR COMING IN.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:43.068
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME, TUCKER.

00:00:39.297 --> 00:00:46.671
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I WAS READING ABOUT

00:00:43.201 --> 00:00:48.673
THIS AND YOU SAID THAT THE

00:00:46.805 --> 00:00:50.842
MASSACRE IN LAS VEGAS URGED YOU

00:00:48.807 --> 00:00:53.412
TO DO THIS.

00:00:50.976 --> 00:00:55.280
WOULD THIS HAVE PRESENTED THAT?

00:00:53.545 --> 00:00:56.415
THAT IF YOU TOLD THIS TO STEPHEN

00:00:55.414 --> 00:00:57.249
PADDOCK THAT HE WOULDN'T HAVE

00:00:56.548 --> 00:00:58.016
OPENED FIRE?

00:00:57.382 --> 00:01:01.420
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:03.555
THAT'S NOT WHAT OUR PROPOSAL IS.

00:01:01.553 --> 00:01:07.893
WE TREAT FIREARM INJURY LIKE A

00:01:03.688 --> 00:01:08.226
PUBLIC HEALTH PROBLEM THAT IT'S

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:09.528
BECOME.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:11.930
ONE OPPORTUNITY TO DO THAT IS

00:01:09.661 --> 00:01:13.832
FOR DOCTOR TO TALK TO PATIENTS

00:01:12.064 --> 00:01:15.033
THAT ARE AT RISK FOR INJURING

00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:18.370
THEMSELVES OR OTHERS WITH GUNS

00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:19.271
AND HOW TO DEAL WITH IT MORE

00:01:18.503 --> 00:01:20.972
SAFELY.

00:01:19.404 --> 00:01:22.074
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO YOU'RE NOT AN

00:01:21.106 --> 00:01:23.875
EXPERT ON GUNS.

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:25.410
WOULD IT BE UNCOMFORTABLE IF I

00:01:24.009 --> 00:01:27.012
GAVE YOU MEDICAL ADVICE?

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:27.746
&gt;&gt; YEAH, THAT WOULD.

00:01:27.145 --> 00:01:29.114
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ME TOO.

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:30.949
THAT'S WHY I WOULDN'T DO IT.

00:01:29.247 --> 00:01:33.151
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT AN EXPERT ON GUNS.

00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:36.521
I AM A MEDICAL EXPERT.

00:01:33.285 --> 00:01:37.756
PART OF WHAT PHYSICIANS DO IS TO

00:01:36.655 --> 00:01:39.791
ASSESS RISK AND HELP TALK TO

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:42.027
THEIR PATIENTS ABOUT MITIGATING

00:01:39.925 --> 00:01:45.163
THOSE RISKS.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:50.836
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ASSESS RISK.

00:01:45.297 --> 00:01:53.672
LIKE WHEN YOU SEND TENS OF

00:01:50.969 --> 00:01:54.639
MILLIONS OF OPIOIDS NO TO

00:01:53.805 --> 00:01:55.941
APPALACHIA.

00:01:54.773 --> 00:01:58.243
HOW ABOUT THAT RISK?

00:01:56.074 --> 00:02:00.779
&gt;&gt; WE DO ASSESS RISK.

00:01:58.376 --> 00:02:02.781
IT WASN'T DOCTORS THAT SEND TENS

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:06.384
OF BILLIONS OF DOSES OF OPIOIDS

00:02:02.914 --> 00:02:07.652
TO APPALACHIA OR OTHER PLAYS.

00:02:06.518 --> 00:02:09.087
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YES, IT WAS.

00:02:07.786 --> 00:02:11.857
&gt;&gt; WE ASSESS HIGH BLOOD

00:02:09.221 --> 00:02:12.991
PRESSURE, SMOKING, RISKY SEXUAL

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.126
BEHAVIOR THAT PEOPLE PUTS AT

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:15.727
RISK FOR INFECTIONS.

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:17.696
LIKE WHEN PEOPLE ARE ELDERLY AND

00:02:15.861 --> 00:02:19.931
AT RISK FOR FALLS.

00:02:17.829 --> 00:02:20.265
WE ASK ABOUT AREA RUGS IN THE

00:02:20.065 --> 00:02:22.467
HOME.

00:02:20.398 --> 00:02:25.070
WE TALK TO PATIENTS ABOUT --

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:25.403
LOTS OF DIFFERENT RISKS THAT WE

00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:27.472
ASSESS.

00:02:25.537 --> 00:02:29.341
THIS PROPOSAL IS TO REMIND

00:02:27.606 --> 00:02:30.976
PHYSICIANS THAT WHEN THEY HAVE A

00:02:29.474 --> 00:02:32.410
PATIENT THAT IS AT RISK FOR

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:34.112
HARMING THEMSELVES OR OTHERS TO

00:02:32.544 --> 00:02:35.914
ASK ABOUT WHETHER THEY HAVE GUNS

00:02:34.246 --> 00:02:39.518
IN THE HOME AND TALK TO THEM

00:02:36.047 --> 00:02:42.621
ABOUT MORE SAFELY STORING THOSE

00:02:39.651 --> 00:02:44.489
GUNS OR OTHER INTERVENTIONS THAT

00:02:42.754 --> 00:02:44.789
CAN MAKE THEM AND THEIR FAMILY

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:45.590
SAFER.

00:02:44.923 --> 00:02:46.591
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WOULD YOU ACKNOWLEDGE

00:02:45.724 --> 00:02:49.928
THAT THERE ARE PEOPLE THAT

00:02:46.725 --> 00:02:51.229
SHOULD HAVE A GUN IN A HOME?

00:02:50.061 --> 00:02:52.497
IF THERE'S A TOUGH AREA WHERE

00:02:51.363 --> 00:02:54.666
THERE'S HOME INVASIONS, WOULD

00:02:52.631 --> 00:02:56.468
YOU'D SAY YOU BETTER HAVE A WAY

00:02:54.799 --> 00:02:58.637
TO DEFEND YOURSELF?

00:02:56.601 --> 00:03:00.906
&gt;&gt; AS A PHYSICIAN I WOULD NOT.

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:03.241
I DON'T THINK THAT THAT WOULD BE

00:03:01.039 --> 00:03:04.643
ANY MY PURVIEW TO DO.

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:05.777
IT'S CERTAINLY PEOPLE'S RIGHT IN

00:03:04.776 --> 00:03:10.248
THIS COUNTRY.

00:03:05.911 --> 00:03:13.151
IF THAT PERSON WAS AT RISK OF

00:03:10.382 --> 00:03:14.853
HARMING THEMSELVES OR OTHERS,

00:03:13.285 --> 00:03:15.220
I'D COUNSEL THEM MAYBE THEY

00:03:14.986 --> 00:03:16.354
SHOULDN'T.

00:03:15.353 --> 00:03:19.191
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IF THE POINT OF THIS

00:03:16.488 --> 00:03:21.259
IS HARM REDUCTION AS YOU CLAIM

00:03:19.324 --> 00:03:22.894
IT WAS, THEN IF SOMEONE WAS A

00:03:21.393 --> 00:03:23.695
DELIVERY MAN IN A TOUGH

00:03:23.028 --> 00:03:25.497
NEIGHBORHOOD DELIVERING THE

00:03:23.828 --> 00:03:26.932
NEWSPAPER OR DELIVERING TO

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:29.501
BODEGAS AT 3:00 A.M., WOULDN'T

00:03:27.065 --> 00:03:32.037
YOU SAY IT'S BETTER TO BE ARMED?

00:03:29.634 --> 00:03:33.605
&gt;&gt; ACTUALLY, TUCKER THERE ARE

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:36.374
DATA OUT THERE THAT SHOW THAT IF

00:03:33.738 --> 00:03:38.944
PEOPLE HAVE ACCESS TO A GUN IN

00:03:36.508 --> 00:03:39.244
THEIR HOME, IT DOESN'T KEEP THEM

00:03:39.077 --> 00:03:40.378
SAFER.

00:03:39.377 --> 00:03:43.114
THEY'RE HIGHER RISK FOR

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:44.549
COMPLETED SUICIDE OR A GUN

00:03:43.248 --> 00:03:46.418
HOMICIDE.

00:03:44.683 --> 00:03:46.718
PEOPLE THAT HAVE GUNS IN THEIR

00:03:46.551 --> 00:03:48.787
HOME.

00:03:46.851 --> 00:03:51.856
SO YOUR ASSUMPTION THAT HAVING A

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:53.358
GUN IN YOUR HOPE KEEPS YOUR

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:54.359
SAFER, THERE'S DAY THAT THAT

00:03:53.491 --> 00:03:55.060
REFUTES THAT ASSUMPTION.

00:03:54.492 --> 00:03:55.860
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I DON'T THINK YOU

00:03:55.193 --> 00:03:57.696
KNOW THE DATA.

00:03:55.994 --> 00:04:00.498
WHEN YOU TAKE SUICIDE OUT OF

00:03:57.829 --> 00:04:01.833
THAT, IT'S A DIFFERENT PICTURE.

00:04:00.632 --> 00:04:03.602
THAT'S A SEPARATE QUESTION TO

00:04:01.967 --> 00:04:04.636
ASK YOU ABOUT.

00:04:03.735 --> 00:04:08.673
WHETHER YOU'RE AGAINST SUICIDE

00:04:04.769 --> 00:04:10.475
AND TRYING TO PREVENT SUICIDE.

00:04:08.807 --> 00:04:11.176
IS THERE NO CIRCUMSTANCE SAFER

00:04:10.609 --> 00:04:12.477
WITH A GUN?

00:04:11.309 --> 00:04:14.379
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:12.611 --> 00:04:20.919
IN THE SYSTEMATIC REVIEW PUN

00:04:14.512 --> 00:04:26.157
ESTABLISHED IN THE ANNALS OF

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:27.325
INTERNAL MEDICINE, SUICIDE AND

00:04:26.291 --> 00:04:29.794
WHETHER THE PERSON HAD GUNS IN

00:04:27.459 --> 00:04:31.896
THE HOME, THE RISK FOR A

00:04:29.928 --> 00:04:32.897
COMPLETED SUICIDE AND THE GUN

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:33.498
HOMICIDE WAS HIGHER FOR

00:04:33.031 --> 00:04:35.500
INDIVIDUALS --

00:04:33.632 --> 00:04:35.900
&gt;&gt; I'M FAMILIAR WITH THOSE

00:04:35.634 --> 00:04:36.968
STATISTICS.

00:04:36.034 --> 00:04:38.970
THEY'RE MISLEADING.

00:04:37.102 --> 00:04:39.471
I'M SURPRISED YOU'RE CITING

00:04:39.104 --> 00:04:40.672
THEM.

00:04:39.604 --> 00:04:41.873
SERIOUS PEOPLE KNOW THAT.

00:04:40.805 --> 00:04:43.508
LET ME ASK YOU THIS.

00:04:42.007 --> 00:04:45.977
I'M DISABLED AND I LIVE AT THE

00:04:43.642 --> 00:04:47.178
END OF A LONG ROAD WHERE THE

00:04:46.111 --> 00:04:48.980
POLICE CAN'T GET THERE WITHIN

00:04:47.312 --> 00:04:51.216
TEN MINUTES, THERE'S HOME

00:04:49.114 --> 00:04:53.418
INVASIONS, I FEEL I NEED A GUN,

00:04:51.349 --> 00:04:53.885
WOULD YOU SAY NO, YOU DON'T NEED

00:04:53.551 --> 00:04:55.920
A GUN?

00:04:54.019 --> 00:04:57.455
WHAT WOULD BE YOUR ADVICE?

00:04:56.054 --> 00:04:59.524
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE PATIENT'S CHOICE.

00:04:57.589 --> 00:05:01.393
BUT IF THE PATIENT WAS DEPRESSED

00:04:59.658 --> 00:05:03.862
AND AT RISK FOR SUICIDE OR

00:05:01.526 --> 00:05:06.698
HAVING HOMICIDAL IDEATIONS OR

00:05:03.995 --> 00:05:07.999
COGNITIVE DEFICITS, I WOULD

00:05:06.831 --> 00:05:09.534
PROBABLY COUNSEL THEM THAT IT

00:05:08.133 --> 00:05:13.204
WAS MORE SAFE FOR THEM NOT TO

00:05:09.668 --> 00:05:13.838
HAVE A GUN THAN HAVE A GUN.

00:05:13.338 --> 00:05:16.041
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT'S FAIR.

00:05:13.972 --> 00:05:16.708
IF THE PERSON WAS GOING TO KILL

00:05:16.174 --> 00:05:18.476
THEMSELVES, YOU'RE RIGHT.

00:05:16.841 --> 00:05:21.646
SO YOU AS AN ORGANIZATION HAVE

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:22.781
TAKEN A STRONG POSITION AGAINST

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.448
SUICIDE, IS THAT RIGHT?

00:05:22.914 --> 00:05:28.486
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:05:23.581 --> 00:05:28.787
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOT ALL PHYSICIANS

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.322
HAVE.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.656
&gt;&gt; MANY PHYSICIANS ARE -- I

00:05:30.455 --> 00:05:33.091
DON'T THINK THERE'S MANY

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.125
PHYSICIANS THAT ADVOCATE

00:05:33.224 --> 00:05:34.759
SUICIDE, TUCKER.

00:05:34.259 --> 00:05:36.061
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I DON'T KNOW.

00:05:34.893 --> 00:05:40.332
LIKE THE ENTIRE STATE OF OREGON

00:05:36.194 --> 00:05:42.334
WHERE IT'S LEGAL AND A LOT OF

00:05:40.465 --> 00:05:48.540
PHYSICIANS PARTICIPATE IN IT.

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:48.907
THERE'S A LOT THAT ARE FOR

00:05:48.673 --> 00:05:50.942
SUICIDE.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.510
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT A

00:05:51.076 --> 00:05:54.579
COMPLETELY DIFFERENT ISSUE.

00:05:52.644 --> 00:05:55.980
YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT ASSISTANT

00:05:54.713 --> 00:05:56.581
SUICIDE FOR THOSE AT THE END OF

00:05:56.114 --> 00:05:58.283
THEIR LIFE.

00:05:56.715 --> 00:05:58.917
THAT HAS NO IDEA --

00:05:58.416 --> 00:05:59.818
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I DON'T KNOW.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:01.853
PEOPLE SHOOT THEMSELVES WITH

00:05:59.951 --> 00:06:03.521
GUNS ALL THE TIME IN TERMINAL

00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:03.855
PAIN OR FACING A TERMINAL

00:06:03.655 --> 00:06:05.557
ILLNESS.

00:06:03.988 --> 00:06:07.425
YOU'RE SAYING SUICIDE IS OKAY

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:10.729
WITH A PHYSICIAN -- I'M TRYING

00:06:07.559 --> 00:06:11.062
TO GET TO THE NUT OF WHAT YOU

00:06:10.862 --> 00:06:13.365
BELIEVE.

00:06:11.196 --> 00:06:15.500
&gt;&gt; I THINK SUICIDE WITH A GUN IS

00:06:13.498 --> 00:06:16.334
MESSY AND NOT SOMETHING THAT

00:06:15.633 --> 00:06:17.535
PHYSICIANS SUPPORT.

00:06:16.468 --> 00:06:18.103
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT IS

00:06:17.669 --> 00:06:20.238
LOST --

00:06:18.236 --> 00:06:21.773
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT SUICIDE WITH A

00:06:20.372 --> 00:06:22.273
NEEDLE IS OKAY.

00:06:21.906 --> 00:06:23.742
&gt;&gt; WHAT?

00:06:22.407 --> 00:06:25.744
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SUICIDE WITH A NEEDLE

00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:27.479
IS OKAY BUT SUICIDE WITH A GUN

00:06:25.877 --> 00:06:30.281
IS WRONG BECAUSE IT'S MESSY?

00:06:27.612 --> 00:06:31.950
IS THAT WHAT YOU'RE SAYING?

00:06:30.415 --> 00:06:34.018
&gt;&gt; IT'S WRONG.

00:06:32.083 --> 00:06:36.554
PHYSICIAN ASSISTED SUICIDE IS

00:06:34.152 --> 00:06:38.957
NOT DONE WITH INJECTION DRUGS.

00:06:36.688 --> 00:06:40.392
YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT EUTHANASIA

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.725
WHICH IS NOT LEGAL IN THIS

00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:42.694
COUNTRY.

00:06:40.859 --> 00:06:43.595
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE DEAD AT THE END NO

00:06:42.827 --> 00:06:44.863
MATTER WHAT.

00:06:43.728 --> 00:06:45.830
DOESN'T SEEM A DIFFERENT

00:06:44.996 --> 00:06:46.865
CATEGORY TO ME.

00:06:45.964 --> 00:06:48.700
OBVIOUSLY YOU DISAGREE.

00:06:46.998 --> 00:06:52.504
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I THOUGHT WE WERE

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:52.837
GOING TO TALK ABOUT THE FIRE AIR

00:06:52.637 --> 00:06:54.539
INJURY?

00:06:52.971 --> 00:06:56.007
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE WERE BUT THE

00:06:54.672 --> 00:06:56.508
MAJORITY ARE SUICIDES AS YOU

00:06:56.141 --> 00:06:57.942
SAID.

00:06:56.641 --> 00:07:00.044
SO YOU'RE TRYING TO PROTECT THEM

00:06:58.076 --> 00:07:01.846
FROM THAT, AS YOU SAID, SO I WAS

00:07:00.178 --> 00:07:03.081
TRYING TO GET TO THE NUB OF WHAT

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:05.717
YOU BELIEVE.

00:07:03.214 --> 00:07:08.553
I DON'T THINK IT'S AN OPTION TO

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:09.087
SPEW PLATITUDES.

00:07:08.686 --> 00:07:11.256
SO --

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.257
&gt;&gt; IF YOU GIVE ME AN

00:07:11.389 --> 00:07:13.625
OPPORTUNITY, I WILL.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.527
SO WHAT --

00:07:13.758 --> 00:07:16.961
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I THINK I HAVE.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.663
DOCTOR, I THINK I'VE GIVEN YOU

